abstract: >
  HERESY v7.2.0 extends the deterministic HERESY/360 stack with a Fortran Public
  Relations Response Simulator. The module consumes the checked-in v7.1 machine
  projection of a maintainer-supplied GitHub status-page snapshot from 17 August
  2026 and emits an original fictional two-person public-affairs interview. The
  program exposes the observed source date, error-rate fields and Packages status,
  explicitly states that no root cause is inferred and no actual GitHub response is
  claimed, conditions derived jokes on supported input fields, rejects malformed or
  ambiguous specimens, performs no network access or model inference, and produces
  deterministic output. The v7.0 due-process stack and v7.1 enterprise-reliability
  replay remain intact.
